Renia explained the Ember Void: an ancient armor forged by Golgarak, who bound his murdered son's soul into it to defy the old god Veniran.
Vera: Power made from a child's stolen life is not a weapon to treat lightly.
Renia: Zanarak has an army. We need power enough to stop him.
Karak felt Grim stir, but the spirit said nothing.
[end_timeline]
